CHAPTER.VERS:
Thus says Yahweh: Yet again there will be heard in this place, of which you

          {+}
         say, It is waste, without man and without beast, even in the cities of Judah, and in the streets of Jerusalem, that are desolate, without man and without inhabitant and without beast,

Thus says Yahweh: If you

          {+}
         can break my covenant of the day, and my covenant of the night, so that there will not be day and night in their season;
